1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,020
Anime means animation from Japan.

2
00:00:03,060 --> 00:00:05,500
Animation is a story with moving pictures.

3
00:00:06,440 --> 00:00:10,420
Anime can be a TV show, a movie, or a short video.

4
00:00:11,100 --> 00:00:11,980
Some anime is funny.

5
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:13,820
Some anime has action.

6
00:00:14,540 --> 00:00:16,020
Some anime is quiet and warm.

7
00:00:16,780 --> 00:00:19,540
You do not need many hard words to talk about it.

8
00:00:20,140 --> 00:00:22,060
Start with the story type and one reason.

9
00:00:22,820 --> 00:00:24,460
Anime has many story types.

10
00:00:24,660 --> 00:00:28,180
An action anime can have fast scenes, big goals, and brave characters.

11
00:00:28,860 --> 00:00:33,160
A school anime can show friends, classes, clubs, and small daily problems.

12
00:00:33,920 --> 00:00:36,160
A comedy anime tries to make people laugh.

13
00:00:36,720 --> 00:00:40,400
A fantasy anime can have magic, strange places, or special powers.

14
00:00:41,340 --> 00:00:43,420
People like anime for different reasons.

15
00:00:44,220 --> 00:00:45,280
The story can be clear.

16
00:00:45,860 --> 00:00:47,800
The characters can be kind or brave.

17
00:00:48,420 --> 00:00:48,760
The music can make a scene feel exciting or warm.

18
00:00:48,760 --> 00:00:58,160
A short episode can also feel easy after a long day.

19
00:00:58,160 --> 00:00:59,520
A good recommendation matches your friend.

20
00:00:59,520 --> 00:01:02,220
A tired friend may want something short and relaxing.

21
00:01:03,280 --> 00:01:04,860
A happy friend may want comedy.

22
00:01:05,920 --> 00:01:07,880
A friend with a lot of energy may want action.

23
00:01:08,920 --> 00:01:11,000
One episode is a simple first step.
